{"timestamp": "2026-10-06T11:04:10.673728+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 492, "candidates_tokens": 130, "total_tokens": 2885, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-06T11:04:10.674207+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "Thank you for the context. We expect a fund of your caliber to have a strong in-house team. Our service is designed to augment, not replace, such talent.\n\nThis leads to a question: during periods of high deal flow, do your analysts ever face bandwidth constraints that create a backlog or force difficult prioritization choices?\n\nWe provide flexible, on-demand due diligence as a supplemental resource. This gives your team overflow capacity, ensuring every promising opportunity gets the attention it deserves without diverting focus from core priorities.\n\nIf that challenge resonates, I would be happy to schedule a brief call to discuss how this model could support your existing process."}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-06T11:04:33.650126+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 501, "candidates_tokens": 241, "total_tokens": 3079, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-06T11:04:33.650720+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "2", "role": "SME", "proposal_text": "An excellent question. Our 6-Pillar DD Framework provides a systematic, multi-vector analysis. It's designed to be exhaustive, allowing your team to focus on higher-order synthesis.\n\nThe pillars are:\n1.  **Team & Founder:** Deep background checks, assessing execution capability and founder-market fit.\n2.  **Tech & Product:** We analyze the technical architecture, scalability, and security posture, including reviewing available code audits.\n3.  **Tokenomics & Governance:** This involves modeling token value accrual, supply dynamics, vesting schedules, and the viability of the governance model.\n4.  **Market Landscape:** We map the competitive environment, TAM/SAM/SOM, and the project's defensible moat.\n5.  **Regulatory & Legal:** A jurisdictional risk assessment, review of corporate structure, and evaluation of potential securities law implications.\n6.  **Ecosystem & Community:** Analysis of on-chain metrics, developer activity, and social sentiment to gauge organic traction.\n\nThis depth allows us to serve as a reliable overflow capacity. During a deal surge, which of these areas typically creates the biggest bottleneck for your analysts?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-06T11:04:47.430543+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 494, "candidates_tokens": 121, "total_tokens": 1879, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-06T11:04:47.431075+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy", "proposal_text": "We appreciate that and often partner with firms that have strong internal research capabilities. Our goal isn't to replace your talent, but to act as a supplemental resource.\n\nWith that in mind, do your analysts ever face periods of high deal flow that create a research backlog, or force them to triage opportunities due to bandwidth constraints?\n\nWe provide on-demand, supplemental due diligence capacity to help firms like yours capture upside during those peak times. This allows your core team to focus on its highest priorities without being over-stretched. Our analysis is based on a structured 6-Pillar DD framework."}
