{"timestamp": "2026-10-06T11:06:42.511539+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 732, "candidates_tokens": 202, "total_tokens": 3241, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-06T11:06:42.512029+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "Excellent questions. Rigor is precisely what makes our supplemental capacity valuable. Our entire process is structured around the OrbLabs 6-Pillar DD Framework to ensure the depth and reproducibility you require.\n\nTo your specific points:\n- **Data Sourcing:** We systematically triangulate marketing narratives against verifiable on-chain data and smart contract analysis.\n- **Team Execution:** We assess this by analyzing repository commit velocity, developer turnover signals, and on-chain governance participation.\n- **Reproducibility:** Every finding in our deliverable is cited back to its raw source (e.g., transaction hash, commit ID), creating a full audit trail for your team.\n\nThe deliverable is a concise report synthesizing these pillars, architected for rapid consumption. It gives your team the verified data they need to focus on final judgment, not preliminary gathering.\n\nThe most effective way to demonstrate this is with a live example. I can walk you through our framework and a redacted report on a brief call."}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-06T11:07:02.773128+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 741, "candidates_tokens": 203, "total_tokens": 2630, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-06T11:07:02.773661+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "2", "role": "SME", "proposal_text": "Excellent questions. Rigor is the foundation of our value. Our methodology is built on the OrbLabs 6-Pillar DD Framework to ensure comprehensive, reproducible analysis.\n\n1.  **Data:** We triangulate primary on-chain data with repository activity and qualitative intel, explicitly scoring marketing claims against verified metrics.\n2.  **Team Execution:** We analyze commit velocity, developer retention, and organizational structure to create a forward-looking execution capability score.\n3.  **QA & Reproducibility:** Our process is built for this. Each pillar has a dedicated analyst, with all findings sourced and cross-validated by a senior lead. This creates a full audit trail.\n\nThe deliverable is a concise report structured around our 6 Pillars (Data, Team, Tech, Tokenomics, Market, Risks), providing a clear synthesis and supporting evidence.\n\nThis structured approach is how we deliver supplemental research that is thorough yet consumable, providing your team with trusted overflow capacity without creating a review backlog."}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-06T11:07:23.458082+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 734, "candidates_tokens": 254, "total_tokens": 2805, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-06T11:07:23.458632+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy", "proposal_text": "Excellent questions. Rigor is non-negotiable, and our methodology is built to ensure it.\n\nOur research is grounded in the OrbLabs 6-Pillar DD Framework, designed for verifiable and reproducible analysis. To address your points:\n\n1.  **Data Validation:** We triangulate data. Our 'Tokenomics & On-Chain' pillar uses direct node data and indexed explorers to validate metrics against marketing claims, which are analyzed separately under our 'Market & Narrative' pillar. Discrepancies are flagged as key risks.\n\n2.  **Team Assessment:** Our 'Team & Execution' pillar analyzes code repository commit velocity and contributor patterns to gauge development activity. We cross-reference this with leadership background checks and network interviews to assess organizational stability.\n\n3.  **Reproducibility & QA:** Each pillar has a standardized data checklist. All sources, queries, and findings are logged in an evidence trail. A senior analyst audits every report against this trail before delivery.\n\nThe deliverable is a structured report with an executive summary, detailed findings for all six pillars, risk scoring, and a data appendix. This ensures the analysis is not a black box, providing your team with reliable, verifiable intelligence that lightens their backlog without sacrificing quality."}
