{"timestamp": "2026-10-06T11:08:05.223156+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "CONSENSUS_RESULT", "winning_proposal_id": 3, "winning_proposal_text": "Excellent questions. Rigor is non-negotiable, and our methodology is built to ensure it.\n\nOur research is grounded in the OrbLabs 6-Pillar DD Framework, designed for verifiable and reproducible analysis. To address your points:\n\n1.  **Data Validation:** We triangulate data. Our 'Tokenomics & On-Chain' pillar uses direct node data and indexed explorers to validate metrics against marketing claims, which are analyzed separately under our 'Market & Narrative' pillar. Discrepancies are flagged as key risks.\n\n2.  **Team Assessment:** Our 'Team & Execution' pillar analyzes code repository commit velocity and contributor patterns to gauge development activity. We cross-reference this with leadership background checks and network interviews to assess organizational stability.\n\n3.  **Reproducibility & QA:** Each pillar has a standardized data checklist. All sources, queries, and findings are logged in an evidence trail. A senior analyst audits every report against this trail before delivery.\n\nThe deliverable is a structured report with an executive summary, detailed findings for all six pillars, risk scoring, and a data appendix. This ensures the analysis is not a black box, providing your team with reliable, verifiable intelligence that lightens their backlog without sacrificing quality.", "gemini_calls_swarm": 6}
