{"timestamp": "2026-10-06T11:08:32.141202+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "SALES_TEAM_OUTBOUND", "turn": 2, "pitch_text": "Excellent questions. What if your deal flow is outpacing your team's capacity for deep diligence, creating analyst fatigue and a growing backlog where crucial details can slip through?\n\nOur 6-Pillar DD Framework delivers verifiable, auditable intelligence\u2014not a black box. We triangulate node data against marketing claims and analyze commit velocity to gauge true development activity. Every source and finding is logged in a complete evidence trail, ensuring rigor.\n\nLet's prove this with a Pillar-4-compliant, risk-reversal PoC. For a single report, you pay our published list rate of $3,500 upfront. If our auditable rigor doesn't save your team measurable hours to focus on high-level strategy, we refund the entire fee.\n\nThis lightens your backlog without sacrificing quality, letting your team do what they do best.", "gemini_calls_this_turn": 9, "pitch_text_raw_length": 822, "pitch_text_sanitized_length": 822, "pitch_text_final_length": 822, "truncated_to_limit": false, "monitor_verdict": "APPROVE", "tier3_hard_gate_passed": true, "overflow_framing_check": {"analyst_pain_language": true, "overflow_framing_language": false}, "conversation_history_chars": 1420}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-06T11:08:32.141415+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GATEKEEPER_REQUEST", "thread_id": "tx_phase3a_purge_on_0a08cf74", "turn": 2, "pitch_text": "Excellent questions. What if your deal flow is outpacing your team's capacity for deep diligence, creating analyst fatigue and a growing backlog where crucial details can slip through?\n\nOur 6-Pillar DD Framework delivers verifiable, auditable intelligence\u2014not a black box. We triangulate node data against marketing claims and analyze commit velocity to gauge true development activity. Every source and finding is logged in a complete evidence trail, ensuring rigor.\n\nLet's prove this with a Pillar-4-compliant, risk-reversal PoC. For a single report, you pay our published list rate of $3,500 upfront. If our auditable rigor doesn't save your team measurable hours to focus on high-level strategy, we refund the entire fee.\n\nThis lightens your backlog without sacrificing quality, letting your team do what they do best.", "conversation_history_chars": 822}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-06T11:08:36.282590+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GATEKEEPER_RESPONSE", "turn": 2, "legacy_status": "REJECTED", "gatekeeper_status": "SOFT_REJECT", "gatekeeper_phase": "INITIAL", "approach_category": "unknown", "exploitation_triggered": false, "reply_text": "I appreciate the direct pivot here\u2014you've actually addressed the core pain. Analyst fatigue and backlog creep is real for us, and your framing around auditable evidence trails resonates.\n\nA few clarifications before we move forward:\n\n1. **The $3,500 PoC\u2014is this strictly upfront, no contingencies?** I need to confirm our procurement flow.\n\n2. **Pillar 4 scope:** which single report would you propose? (e.g., one protocol, one chain analysis, one team assessment?)\n\n3. **Measurement:** you mention \"measurable hours saved\"\u2014do you have a standard baseline metric your clients use, or do we define it together in the kickoff?\n\nIf those land cleanly, let's schedule a brief video walkthrough next week. I want to see the actual framework before we cut a check."}
